{"id":"n81598-1-6","stage":4,"title":"초상 · 丧","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81598-1-6-1","ko":"검은 양복은 왜요? 어디 초상이라도 났어요?","zh":"为什么穿黑西装？谁家有人去世了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"검은","meaning":"黑","explanation":"검다：黑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"검다","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62259","senseId":"1","lemma":"검다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검은","audio":"/audio/6fec93722a833ef0ec3e.mp3"}},{"text":"양복은","meaning":"西装","explanation":"양복：西装；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양복은","audio":"/audio/e788c85f97725bee3157.mp3"}},{"text":"왜요?","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜요","audio":"/audio/00ebba6f9d5802dfa766.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"怎么，哪里，哪能","explanation":"어디：怎么，哪里，哪能","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60320","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"초상이라도","meaning":"丧，丧事，初丧","explanation":"초상：丧，丧事，初丧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"초상","audio":"/audio/90ca68c76621bfdd5d38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81598","senseId":"1","lemma":"초상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초상이라도","audio":"/audio/5aea618d778ec91e5ab3.mp3"}},{"text":"났어요?","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났어요","audio":"/audio/d2257d19ac11ac6e987c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a665a697a61a0146","term":"검다","zh":"黑","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3","entryId":"62259","definition":"颜色和没有光线的夜空一样又暗又浓。","pronunciation":["검ː따"]},{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"怎么，哪里，哪能","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60320","definition":"用于反问的语气，意在强调。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"90ca68c76621bfdd","term":"초상","zh":"丧，丧事，初丧","audio":"/audio/90ca68c76621bfdd5d38.mp3","entryId":"81598","definition":"人死后举行葬礼等事。","pronunciation":["초상"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f56248b0694faa63780.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81598-1-6-2","ko":"김 부장님이 돌아가셨어.","zh":"金部长去世了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"부장님이","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부장님이","audio":"/audio/406e95ae8d8b0f67e78a.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가셨어.","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가셨어","audio":"/audio/c47ed51f3c8f541eb399.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6dd635cc6ab81179fddd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.558,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81598","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.3847,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为什么穿黑西装？谁家有人去世了吗？","金部长去世了。","小说的书页间掉出来一张照片。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为什么穿黑西装？谁家有人去世了吗？","金部长去世了。","小说的书页间掉出来一张照片。"],"answer":1}]}
